 high school football student  who stands out who also has a tenuous  relationship with his father  a scientist at star labs and when his  father misses yet another one of his  football games victor goes to confront  his father at his lab where he's working  on a mother box a piece of fourth world  technology used by the new gods now  mother boxes are basically super  computers that can perform a variety of  functions such as energy manipulation  healing and teleportation through  summoning boom tubes which also allow  for interstellar travel but regardless  the mother box explodes killing nearly  everybody in the room and gravely  injuring victor now similar to his first  origin story  vic's father saves him through the use  of technology outfitting him with  cybernetic parts and injecting him with  nanites  but victor is also drastically changed  by the energy emitted by the motherbox  which now becomes part of his physiology  and so instead of him going on to join  the teen titans in this continuity  victor is actually a founding member of  the justice league something teen titans  fans were pissed about now as for his  powers the cybernetic parts that make up  much of cyborg's body provide him  with superhuman strength speed stamina  and durability the computer system that  exists within him  also allows him to communicate with  other computers and also grants him a  variety of other abilities  for instance his artificial eye grants  him superhuman vision and he can store a  variety of weapons including lasers a  grappling hook and a sound cannon that  incapacitates enemies and is powerful  enough to shatter stone but due to the  nature of technology  cyborg is able to upgrade his powers as  he discovers new ways to augment them  the motherbox technology that exists  within cyborg also grants him several  abilities such as the ability to produce  powerful emp blasts to summon boom tubes  which allow him to travel anywhere in  the universe instantaneously and find  some measure of a way to stay relevant  in comic books on top of that  cyborg's iq has been measured at 170  meaning he possesses a genius level  intellect but not enough since to  realize that the justice league keeps  him around because somebody has to guard  the watchtower but with that in mind how  do we go about killing cyborg well i  think the first thing that we have to do  is find a way to neutralize the  motherbox technology that exists within  him now as long as he's able to generate  boom tubes  cyborg will be able to disappear  instantaneously and wind up literally  anywhere in the universe and so how can  we do that well mother boxes  never run out of energy so we can't try  any sort of energy siphoning because  they'll simply just siphon more energy  from the source which is a limitless  reserve of energy that's never exhausted  mother boxes can be destroyed however  we're not really dealing with a physical  mother box here but energy from the  mother box that has been incorporated  into the technology  running throughout cyborg's body at any  rate even if they are destroyed they can  typically be regenerated but there is  one exception to this  as it turns out mother boxes cannot  function if their users  lack the spiritual integrity to wield it  for instance when orion one of the new  gods was infected with the anti-life  equation his mother box  ceased to function and i think that  gives us a pretty good idea  of what we will need to do to sever  cyborg's connection to his mother box  taking away not only his ability to use  boom tubes but denying him access to a  multitude of powers the fourth world  technology grants him what we're going  to have to do here  is infect cyborg with the anti-life  equation and hope the events of dc's  don't take place where he basically  kills the world now while this sounds  simple enough  in theory it's going to be incredibly  difficult in practice the anti-life  equation  has been doggedly sought out by darkseid  for centuries so it's not like we can  just readily access it but hey that's  why i said cyborg was more difficult to  kill than people realize  if it was easy it wouldn't make for a  very interesting video but our task  isn't just over by infecting cyborg with  the anti-life equation  although his connection to the mother  box is severed he still has the  cybernetic enhancements to his body that  we need to deal with  as they still grant him a variety of  abilities he'll still have greatly  enhanced strength and durability that  we'll have to deal with as well as the  bevy of offensive weapons that we  mentioned earlier  and most worrisome is his ability to  interface with pretty much any  technology that he wants to  and so that opens up a lot more  possibilities for him to either surveil  us or avoid our attacks  or to take us out before we attack him i  mean just to give me perspective  he could literally just communicate with  all the computers controlling some  tomahawk missiles and launch them all at  us which would make killing him  impossible  since we'd be dead and so our next step  has to be to take out cyborg's  technological enhancements and to do  that  i think we have a few options such as  infecting him with some sort of computer  virus or maybe generating an  electromagnetic pulse to shut down his  cybernetic component  if we take those components out vic is  then going to have  a lot of extra weight to drag around and  taking him out becomes a lot easier but  failing any of that  another way we get the job done is  actually to the use of a psychic attack  the cybernetic implants to cyborg  are a source of strength but they can  also be his weakness as he has had  trouble in the past with retaining his  humanity as he's always felt like he's  more machine  than man and so if we're able to  effectively shut off his mind the  technological parts of cyborg will have  a free reign to overtake the human side  of him and vic would effectively be no  more while this technically accomplishes  our mission  at the end we're still going to be left  with an artificially intelligent robot  with vast powers to deal with so i don't  really think this is an ideal plan for  us to go down but yeah like i said guys  killing cyborg  is deceptively difficult right but if  you guys have any better ideas leave  them down in the comments section  because i'm curious to see what you guys  come  up with with that being said we're gonna  bring this video to an end if you are  new here to comments explain  make sure you guys hit the sub button to  become part of the rob core if you guys  enjoyed this video make sure you drop a  like  and i will catch you all later peace  [Music]  so  [Music]  [Music]  so

